    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105866" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύ̆λ-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
